Type switch with a bound variable: case Temporary -> nil; case *OpError -> e.Err; case nil; default -> e.
Expect *NetError removed; ErrNotFound (fmt.Errorf chain) and ErrRateLimited via default. The *OpError case
returns the field e.Err: ErrTimeout WITHOUT an OpError.Unwrap chain, or an Unresolved entry for the field
read (fields are out of scope) - but it must not vanish silently and must not keep the Unwrap chain.
-- args --
processor/as.go:@typeSwitchIface
